posts.text:
Appalled that @timnitgebru, AI ethics icon, can’t lay off a lovely 87-year-old man, one of the great scientists of our time, whose journalist son was kidnapped and publicly beheaded in an act of political violence. 

Her power has gone to her head;
her humanity has vanished.

